.researchgate.net/publication/9309353_The_Hydrolysis_of_Arginine)\n32. [Reasons for the occurrence of the twenty coded protein ...](https://citeseerx.ist.psu.edu/document?doi=167961801406af19852f76f62e796fa905c99643&repid=rep1&type=pdf)\n33. [Reasons for the occurrence of the twenty coded protein amino acids - ADS](https://ui.adsabs.harvard.edu/abs/1981JMolE..17..273W)\n34. [Consensus temporal order of amino acids and evolution of the triplet code](https://www.researchgate.net/publication/12166018_Consensus_temporal_order_of_amino_acids_and_evolution_of_the_triplet_code)\n35. [Order of amino acid recruitment into the genetic code resolved by last universal common ancestor\u2019s protein domains](https://www.pnas.org/doi/10.1073/pnas.2410311121)\n\n\nKey Citations:\n  1. Common origins of RNA, protein and lipid precursors in a cyanosulfidic protometabolism - Nature Chemistry (https://www.nature.com/articles/nchem.2202)\n  2. Common origins of RNA, protein and lipid precursors in a cyanosulfidic protometabolism - PMC (https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4568310/)\n  3. Chemical evolution (https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/BF01797455)\n  4. Chemical evolution: XXI. The Amino Acids Released on Hydrolysis of HCN Oligomers - ADS (https://ui.adsabs.harvard.edu/abs/1974JMolE...3..225F/abstract)\n  5. Possible role of hydrogen cyanide in chemical evolution: Investigation of the proposed direct synthesis of peptides from hydrogen cyanide - ScienceDirect (https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/abs/pii/0022283673900429)\n  6. (PDF) Primordial synthesis of amines and amino acids in a 1958 Miller H 2 S-rich spark discharge experiment (https://www.academia.edu/91151237/Primordial_synthesis_of_amines_and_amino_acids_in_a_1958_Miller_H_2_S_rich_spark_discharge_experiment)\n  7. (PDF) The Miller Volcanic Spark Discharge Experiment (https://www.academia.edu/121732208/The_Miller_Volcanic_Spark_Discharge_Experiment)\n  8. Primordial synthesis of amines and amino acid